{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Frontend Package Corporate Websites und Relaunches","created_at":"2025-10-17T09:03:32.002Z","published_at":"2025-12-15T08:50:54.662Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T08:50:54.684Z","id":102409060404436,"uuid":"5081fcba-63a3-4e7e-a546-dc9feca0af62","content":{"_uid":"9620b257-4cc1-4bc0-a243-f177280b812e","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"98157566-4ede-4990-a217-d5d8285cb626","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"8911a6f3-1531-468d-b4e2-0eff32b50ad7","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"Zusammenstellung einiger Marken-Anwendungen und Screenshots, die das Frontend Package zeigen","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"none","textPosition":"","highlightText":false,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2391x921/16bde08709/composable-frontend-examples.png","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2391x921/16bde08709/composable-frontend-examples.png"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"Wie Marketeers mit den sofort einsatzbereiten CMS-Komponenten in Tagen neue digitale Touchpoints aufbaust – konsistent, flexibel und Backend-unabhängig.\n","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Corporate Frontend Package in Action","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"2ea37f2d-f492-4939-9b86-05b0b54eac5d","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[{"_uid":"25ca2b33-2c9a-404a-9496-115fab7c782c","icon":"","label":"Live Demo buchen?","target":"ueber-uns/kontakt","component":"buttons"}],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"d14ebfba-6f3e-4662-9e03-0a5912e99787","text":"Märkte, Produkte, Kampagnen – alles verändert sich schneller als je zuvor. Doch viele Websites sind träge. Neue Kampagnen dauern Wochen, bis sie live gehen.\n\nDas **Frontend Package** macht euch unabhängig von Release-Zyklen. Es ist der Teil eurer digitalen Plattform, der Innovation wieder in Marketinghände legt. \n\nStatt jedes Projekt neu zu entwickeln, setzt du auf ein fertiges System, das Gestaltung, Komponenten und Datenflüsse intelligent verbindet, **ready to go** für jede Herausforderung.\n\n\n","type":"text","align":"left","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false},{"_uid":"48922d9d-2815-4fe6-a1d5-543ed9af6aa6","type":"features","style":"stack","layout":"smallTiles","feature":[{"_uid":"93e0c751-91b6-42ad-894e-08e9777b5449","icon":"time","text":"","type":"feature","style":"besideSmall","title":"Schneller live – von der Idee zur veröffentlichten Seite in Stunden","component":"feature","cta_label":"See more","cta_style":"link","cta_target":"#","cta_toggle":false},{"_uid":"ab7c8cec-3575-4aa5-9b7f-489cd1ececc3","icon":"color-palette","text":"","type":"feature","style":"besideLarge","title":"Markenkonform – konsistente UX auf allen Kanälen","component":"feature","cta_label":"See more","cta_style":"link","cta_target":"#","cta_toggle":false},{"_uid":"24bef62d-31ac-4c33-b800-537514938f5f","icon":"hexagon","text":"","type":"feature","style":"besideLarge","title":"Backend egal – unabhängig von Tools, flexibel für jede Zukunft","component":"feature","cta_label":"See more","cta_style":"link","cta_target":"#","cta_toggle":false}],"component":"features","ctas_style":"link","ctas_toggle":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"Kampagnenzyklen werden kürzer, Budgets müssen wirken und trotzdem sollen alle Kanäle einheitlich aussehen.","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Schnelligkeit trifft Markenführung","content_gutter":"large","headline_align":"left","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"narrow","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"e96cd38d-1e8c-47eb-8aa3-bfdacd7d6ffc","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"be6d8da9-1d4e-459e-abd6-2326ae27f1db","text":"## Ein Baukasten – unendlich viele Möglichkeiten\n\nDas Frontend Package ist dein skalierbarer Baukasten für moderne Markenkommunikation. Jede Komponente ist auf Wiederverwendbarkeit und Storytelling ausgelegt: vom Hero-Banner bis zum Filtergrid, vom Teaser bis zur Detailseite.\n\nOb Landing Page, Portale, Produktdarstellung, Jobs-Seiten oder Eventplattform – du gestaltest deine digitalen Erlebnisse auf derselben Basis, immer im Einklang mit deinem Corporate Design, schnell, brandkonform und mit maximaler Freiheit.\n\n**Markenstark. Strukturiert. Sofort einsatzbereit.**","type":"image-text","layout":"above","component":"image-text","image_alt":"Zusammenstellung einiger Screenshots, die das Frontend Package zeigen","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1644x587/02bd404bb0/rm-corporate-ui-comp-02.png","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"","headline_align":"left","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"","headline_textAlign":"left","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"98f5191c-dc04-4d5a-a36a-436929b96689","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"a3bac277-6f2f-4751-bcbf-7dfcbfcde4ad","text":"Wie könnte dein Online-Auftritt morgen aussehen, wenn Website, Kampagnen und Events auf demselben Design System basieren?\n\nUnsere Showcases zeigen dir praxisnahe Szenarien, die du mit dem Frontend Package sofort umsetzen kannst.","type":"text","align":"left","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"small","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"Use Cases","content_align":"left","content_width":"narrow","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Inspiration für deine neue digitale Plattform","content_gutter":"large","headline_align":"left","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"narrow","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"smallest","headline_textAlign":"left","headline_switchOrder":true},{"_uid":"eb1229e6-8045-416c-9c7b-8eeece145d4e","type":"section","style":"boldTransition","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"68387440-e941-4453-a993-d0caf2c3306d","text":"Corporate Website oder Landing Page, mit diesen UI-Modulen wird Dein Inhalt angezeigt, wie du es willst. Inklusiver vielfältiger Layout-Optionen","type":"teaser-card","label":"","layout":"stack","target":"#","headline":"CMS Content","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"wide","button_label":"CMS Content Use Case","button_hidden":false,"button_chevron":true},{"_uid":"7260d3fd-9de3-42a2-88d3-aca6c1a2d4db","text":"für alle deine Veranstaltungen – mit einheitlicher Darstellung, egal aus welchem System hintenrum die Daten stammen.","type":"teaser-card","label":"","layout":"stack","target":"#","headline":"Event Hub","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"wide","button_label":"Events Use Case","button_hidden":false,"button_chevron":true},{"_uid":"d0db30af-f0df-4ed4-b20d-f2cf66661016","text":"Produktdarstellung mit Persönlichkeit trotz variabler Informationsdichte, redaktionell frei und in markentreuen Design.","type":"teaser-card","label":"","layout":"stack","target":"#","headline":"Produktkatalog","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"wide","button_label":"Produktseiten Beispiele","button_hidden":false,"button_chevron":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"large","headline_align":"left","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"left","headline_switchOrder":true},{"_uid":"7f6ff6f4-a27b-4bee-b7e4-3d31c953695a","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"fe619100-22ef-4d9a-a9cb-3b08d8aee65a","text":"Das **Frontend Package** basiert auf strukturierten, wiederverwendbaren Komponenten, die mit jedem modernem CMS, PIM oder DAM verbunden werden können. Datenquellen und Systeme bleiben flexibel, das Markenerlebnis bleibt stabil.\n\nSo entstehen Websites, die sich an jede Plattform anschließen und sich trotzdem wie eine durchgängige Markenwelt anfühlen.\n\n- Headless & API-ready\n- Modular & Design-System-basiert\n- Barrierefrei & SEO-optimiert\n- Zukunftssicher & skalierbar","type":"image-text","layout":"beside_right","component":"image-text","image_alt":"Zusammenstellung einiger Screenshots, die das Frontend Package zeigen","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1318x669/1d5ae700a5/rm-corporate-ui-comp-03.png","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Technologie, die sich deiner Marke anpasst, nicht umgekehrt","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"left","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"narrow","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"left","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"403e4485-8b15-4a0e-a34b-a3dd0246597e","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"e9ae6b95-672a-4b9f-9128-37ca55add343","component":"global_reference","reference":[{"_uid":"335afe5f-675a-4306-a802-38dc18a88b78","global":[{"_uid":"3db8d8c9-6f14-45f0-b521-61d9f5244b6d","type":"testimonials","layout":"slider","component":"testimonials","quoteSigns":"large","testimonial":[{"_uid":"e994bdbc-c4d0-4cf1-abab-14f203c2dfc8","name":"Elis Westpfahl","type":"testimonial","quote":"Dank ruhmesmeile haben wir unser Produkt maßgeschneidert optimiert. Die erstellten Websites überzeugen durch sehr gute Performance und sind extrem einfach zu pflegen. Besonders das entwickelte Whitelabel-Design System ermöglicht es uns, neue Energie-Buchungsstrecken sehr effizient aufzusetzen.","title":"– Leitung Key Account Management der encore GmbH","rating":"","component":"testimonial","image_alt":"Elis Westphal Portrait","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/520x616/03d39039fe/elis-quote.png"},{"_uid":"db027983-50d7-4497-b9c1-a9a4c75a2882","name":"Stephan Weiß","type":"testimonial","quote":"Als einer der größten deutschen Logistiker haben wir in der digitalen Welt an Geschwindigkeit zugelegt – mit einem skalierbaren und effizienten digitalen Design System, dass Radikant und ruhmesmeile entwickelt haben.","title":"– Department Head Digital Media bei DACHSER SE","rating":"","component":"testimonial","image_alt":"Dachser Logo","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/520x564/0584c663af/logo-dachser-round.svg"}]}],"component":"global","slug":"global/testimonials-slider"}]}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"left","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Was unsere Kunden sagen","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"19f1301a-af2d-48f4-b779-bf4d8cff8e7f","type":"section","s